[00:19.87]1. “The signs of the times” prove God’s rule has begun.
[00:28.12]In glory enthroned sits Jehovah’s Son.
[00:33.12]The heavens are cleansed, Satan’s now debased,
[00:38.12]And soon on the earth let God’s will take place.
[00:42.12](Chorus)
[00:46.12]Rejoice! For God’s tent is with men,
[00:53.37]And he himself resides with them.
[00:59.71]No more will there be pain or worrying,
[01:06.21]No sting of death nor any sorrowing.
[01:12.71]For God has said: ‘I’m making all things new.’
[01:18.71]These words faithful are and true.
[01:45.50]2. Let all men the pure New Jerusalem see,
[01:51.74]The bride of the Lamb shining radiantly.
[01:58.30]Adorned for her husband in gems so bright,
[02:04.70]And only Jehovah will be her light.
[02:11.80](Chorus)
[02:16.14]Rejoice! For God’s tent is with men,
[02:20.47]And he himself resides with them.
[02:25.72]No more will there be pain or worrying,
[02:31.96]No sting of death nor any sorrowing.
[02:38.52]For God has said: ‘I’m making all things new.’
[02:56.51]These words faithful are and true.
[03:14.49]3. This city so grand will become a delight.
[03:21.09]Its gates will be open both day and night.
[03:27.59]The nations will walk in her glory bright;
[03:31.29]The servants of God now reflect that light.
[03:36.96](Chorus)
[03:42.62]Rejoice! For God’s tent is with men,
[03:48.28]And he himself resides with them.
[03:54.72]No more will there be pain or worrying,
[04:01.08]No sting of death nor any sorrowing.
[04:07.58]For God has said: ‘I’m making all things new.’
[04:15.42]These words faithful are and true.